### PG 통합 테스트

### 1. PG Simulator Health Check
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Commerce API Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Commerce API를 통한 PG 결제 요청 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/test/request
X-USER-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "TEST-ORDER-001",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 5000
}

### 4. PG 결제 상태 조회 (transactionKey는 위 응답에서 확인)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/test/status/20250816:TR:9577c5
X-USER-ID: 1
Accept: application/json

### 5. 직접 PG Simulator 호출 (비교용)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
X-USER-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "DIRECT-ORDER-001",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 10000,
  "callbackUrl": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback"
}

### 6. Circuit Breaker 상태 확인
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/circuitbreakers
Accept: application/json

### 7. Circuit Breaker 이벤트 확인
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/circuitbreakerevents
Accept: application/json

### 8. Resilience4j 메트릭 확인 (Prometheus)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain
